title    Grenzallee
about    Arena rock for the drive out to the Ringbahn. A palm-muted chug in B minor, a synth lead singing the verse, a chorus that opens out into big chords and organ, and a guitar solo on top.
tempo    116
beats    4
steps    4
reverb   0.3

# Verse Bm, G, D, A; the climb Em, G, A; chorus D, A over C#, Bm, G.
voice lead  saw      vol=0.4  pan=0.05 glide=0.08 gate=0.95 bright=0.7
voice solo  drive    vol=0.6  pan=0.1  glide=0.07
voice chug  drive    vol=0.45 pan=-0.4 gate=0.45 bright=0.6
voice crunch drive   vol=0.45 pan=0.4  gate=0.95
voice brass brass    vol=0.4  pan=-0.1 center=F#4
voice pad   organ    vol=0.28 pan=0.25 center=F#4
voice bass  ebass    vol=0.9
voice kick  kick     vol=0.85
voice snare snare    vol=0.65
voice hat   hat      vol=0.35 pan=0.2
voice ride  ride     vol=0.3  pan=0.25
voice crash crash    vol=0.35 pan=-0.25
voice tomh  tomhi    vol=0.5  pan=-0.2
voice toml  tomlo    vol=0.55 pan=0.2

pattern intro
brass  | [D]-- [D]-- [D]- .... [D]--- | [A/C#]-- [A/C#]-- [A/C#]- .... [A/C#]--- | [Bm]-- [Bm]-- [Bm]- .... [Bm]--- | [G]--- [G]--- [A]------- |
bass   | D2- D2- D2- D2- D2- D2- D2- D2- | C#2- C#2- C#2- C#2- C#2- C#2- C#2- C#2- | B1- B1- B1- B1- B1- B1- B1- B1- | G1- G1- G1- G1- A1- A1- A1- A1- |
kick   | x... ..x. x... .... | % | % | x... ..x. x... x... |
snare  | .... x... .... x... | % | % | .... x... xxxx xxxx |
hat    | x.x. x.x. x.x. x.x. | % | % | x.x. x.x. .... .... |
crash  | x... .... .... .... | _ | _ | _ |

pattern verse
chug   | B2+F#3- B2+F#3- B2+F#3- B2+F#3- B2+F#3- B2+F#3- B2+F#3- B2+F#3- | G2+D3- G2+D3- G2+D3- G2+D3- G2+D3- G2+D3- G2+D3- G2+D3- | D3+A3- D3+A3- D3+A3- D3+A3- D3+A3- D3+A3- D3+A3- D3+A3- | A2+E3- A2+E3- A2+E3- A2+E3- A2+E3- A2+E3- A2+E3- A2+E3- |
chug   | B2+F#3- B2+F#3- B2+F#3- B2+F#3- B2+F#3- B2+F#3- B2+F#3- B2+F#3- | G2+D3- G2+D3- G2+D3- G2+D3- G2+D3- G2+D3- G2+D3- G2+D3- | D3+A3- D3+A3- D3+A3- D3+A3- D3+A3- D3+A3- D3+A3- D3+A3- | A2+E3- A2+E3- A2+E3- A2+E3- A2+E3- A2+E3- A2+E3- A2+E3- |
bass   | B1- B1- B1- B1- B1- B1- B1- B1- | G1- G1- G1- G1- G1- G1- G1- G1- | D2- D2- D2- D2- D2- D2- D2- D2- | A1- A1- A1- A1- A1- A1- A1- A1- |
bass   | B1- B1- B1- B1- B1- B1- B1- B1- | G1- G1- G1- G1- G1- G1- G1- G1- | D2- D2- D2- D2- D2- D2- D2- D2- | A1- A1- A1- A1- A1- A1- A1- A1- |
lead   | .... F#4- F#4- F#4- E4- D4- E4- | F#4--- D4--- .... .. B3- | .... F#4- F#4- A4- F#4- E4- D4- | E4----------- .... |
lead   | .... F#4- F#4- F#4- E4- D4- E4- | F#4--- G4--- .... .. G4- | A4--- F#4- E4- D4--- E4- F#4- | E4----------- .... |
kick   | x... ..x. x... .... | % | % | % | % | % | % | x... ..x. x... x... |
snare  | .... x... .... x... | % | % | % | % | % | % | .... x... .... xxxx |
